       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. LINKAGEDEMO.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-MAIN-VAL PIC X(20) VALUE 'FROM MAIN'.

       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 LS-PARM PIC X(20).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LS-PARM.
       MAIN-PARA.
           DISPLAY LS-PARM.
           MOVE LS-PARM TO WS-MAIN-VAL.
           DISPLAY WS-MAIN-VAL.
           STOP RUN.
